<Base title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy for PW Fit Guide, including cookies, analytics, and advertising." path="/privacy/">
  <div class="prose">
    <p class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated 3 September 2026.</p>
    <p>PW Fit Guide (“the site”) is a static reference. We do not ask you to create an account.</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Server and CDN logs.</strong> The host (for example Cloudflare Pages) may record IP address, user agent, and requested URL for security and reliability.</li>
      <li><strong>Search Console / analytics.</strong> If enabled, Google Search Console and privacy-friendly analytics (Cloudflare Web Analytics or similar) collect aggregated traffic data.</li>
      <li><strong>Email.</strong> If you write to the contact address, we keep the message long enough to answer it.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
    <p>This site is built to carry Google AdSense once the publisher account is approved. Google and its partners use cookies and similar technologies to serve and measure ads, including personalized ads where allowed. You can opt out of personalized ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">Google Ads Settings</a> and learn more at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads">Google’s advertising page</a>.</p>
    <p>We do not sell your email address or a list of pages you read. We do not run a login, paywall, or comment stack.</p>
    <h2>Legal pages Google expects</h2>
    <p>A working <a href="/contact/">contact</a> method and this policy are here so the site can be reviewed as a real publication, not an empty ad wrapper.</p>
    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>The site is not directed at children under 13. High-pressure equipment is not a toy.</p>
    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>If the advertising or analytics stack changes, we will update this page and the date above.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
